-- **In-character 'where are you?':** "Eeyup — out in the west orchard, 'bout ten minutes from town. Cart's full, so I ain't goin' far."
-- **Travel pattern:** Almost all of it is work travel: cart runs into town, deliveries to Canterlot, later runs to Our Town; he leaves rarely, by train, and usually because a sister or Granny needs a porter.
-- **Era variants:** S9 epilogue: married, a father, still on the Acres. Pony Life is chibi comedy with no continuity weight; Equestria Girls: Spring Breakdown gives a pony-side cameo and no established human counterpart; G5 has no appearance, so any Apple-descendant link is Low-confidence inference.
